# the same function with escape analysis withheld: the call ends what was known of the slot, so the field is read again and the object is made
# RUN: walk f1 mechanisms=none+TypedOperations+Folding
# CHECK-LABEL: code f1:Body
# CHECK: = NewObject {{*}}layout=L0
# CHECK: = Call
# CHECK: [[x]]: {{*}}Get{{*}}key="x"
# CHECK: Return [[x]]
# PROGRAM-OF: object-that-never-leaves-is-read-out-of-the-state.ir
